<section id="areas" class="w-full px-[var(--page-px)] light bg-background text-ink py-[var(--band-py-tight)]" data-slot="section"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 md:flex-row md:gap-14"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 md:w-[500px] md:gap-3.5"><p class="font-medium text-[10px] md:text-[11.5px] tracking-[0.15em] md:tracking-[0.16em] text-primary" data-slot="eyebrow">SERVICE AREA</p><h2 class="font-display [font-weight:700] max-w-[54rem] tracking-[-0.005em] leading-[1.16] md:leading-[1.14] text-[calc(1.5625rem*var(--display-scale))] md:text-[calc(2.625rem*var(--display-scale))]" data-slot="display">Thirty miles of Portland. We turn down everything past it.</h2><p class="text-[15px] md:text-[16.5px] leading-[1.62] text-ink-soft">A two-hour window we cannot actually hit is worth nothing to you, so we do not sell one. If you are outside the radius we will say so on the phone and point you at someone closer.</p></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-wrap content-start gap-2.5"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center border font-medium w-fit whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 gap-1 overflow-hidden [&#38;&#62;svg]:size-3 [&#38;&#62;svg]:pointer-events-none transition-[color,box-shadow] focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-accent-error/20 aria-invalid:border-accent-error [a&#38;]:hover:bg-hover [a&#38;]:hover:text-ink rounded-full bg-card px-4 py-2.5 text-[14px] text-ink-mid" data-slot="badge">Portland — all quadrants</span><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center border font-medium w-fit whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 gap-1 overflow-hidden [&#38;&#62;svg]:size-3 [&#38;&#62;svg]:pointer-events-none transition-[color,box-shadow] focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-accent-error/20 aria-invalid:border-accent-error [a&#38;]:hover:bg-hover [a&#38;]:hover:text-ink rounded-full bg-card px-4 py-2.5 text-[14px] text-ink-mid" data-slot="badge">Beaverton</span><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bo